01:05:39.020 --> 01:05:47.020
But how could you say? I mean, what does it mean to shoot? Ultimately, trust each other. Trust another Jew.

01:05:47.020 --> 01:05:53.020
How do I know that my wife put the salt in the... It's a question of trust.

01:05:53.020 --> 01:05:55.020
How do you know that my wife...

01:05:55.020 --> 01:06:00.020
