01:06:00.020 --> 01:06:05.520
Tell you an interesting story. My mother, when she was already 80, my mother died from the rest of the pieces when she was 93.

01:06:06.540 --> 01:06:10.580
So we lived on Miami Garden Drive, and the whole street was mostly on that street.

01:06:11.620 --> 01:06:14.280
