01:06:15.100 --> 01:06:22.160
So one day, a couple of young students, I tell them, tourists, Shira students, knock on it.

01:06:23.480 --> 01:06:26.060
I'd already helped start the first products in the beach.

01:06:26.060 --> 01:06:31.880
I brought the land out of my pocket, whatever, and then everybody else helped, and we finally bought it, and we built it, whatever happened.

01:06:33.300 --> 01:06:35.680
So, I mean, but I'm not a yeshiva student.

01:06:35.880 --> 01:06:36.640
