01:06:37.060 --> 01:06:39.600
I can read it, but I can't interpret it.

01:06:40.840 --> 01:06:42.500
I'm really a neophyte.

01:06:42.540 --> 01:06:44.400
All my reading is in English, which is quite a bit.

01:06:44.580 --> 01:06:48.720
But anyway, so this man knocks on the door, and there's a couple of young guys going through the door.

01:06:49.520 --> 01:06:51.760
We greet them, come inside, and so on and so forth.

01:06:52.360 --> 01:06:54.460
And they start trying to convert us.

01:06:54.460 --> 01:06:57.860
I said, please, it's not necessary every single morning.

01:06:58.520 --> 01:07:03.120
And I go to the synagogue, and we found a synagogue in this area, and so on and so forth.

01:07:03.320 --> 01:07:06.580
And I know already not to offer these guys anything.

01:07:06.780 --> 01:07:07.620
Because it was, yes.

01:07:08.200 --> 01:07:09.900
That's all we offer on a paper plate.

01:07:10.060 --> 01:07:11.480
I respect them, whatever they are.

01:07:11.720 --> 01:07:17.280
Of course, I remember Rabbi Al-Khalay, they asked him, what would you do to go to somebody's house?

01:07:17.360 --> 01:07:18.260
He wouldn't have sold to anybody.

01:07:18.400 --> 01:07:22.060
He says, leave the shell on and give me a piece of fruit, and I'm fine.

01:07:22.380 --> 01:07:23.700
It's the fruit he can eat himself.

01:07:23.700 --> 01:07:24.360
they can wash it, whatever.

01:07:24.860 --> 01:07:26.600
So we offered them some food or whatever it was.

01:07:27.100 --> 01:07:28.500
