01:07:30.560 --> 01:07:32.460
My mother, who was already 80 years old,

01:07:32.780 --> 01:07:35.720
you know, gets up and wants to thank her for coming.

01:07:35.900 --> 01:07:37.260
And she wouldn't touch a hand.

01:07:37.660 --> 01:07:37.940
Okay?

01:07:38.300 --> 01:07:39.140
She wouldn't touch a hand.

01:07:39.900 --> 01:07:40.380
So they left.

01:07:40.460 --> 01:07:41.300
My mother was very hurt.

01:07:41.380 --> 01:07:43.380
She says, I'm 80 years old.

01:07:43.480 --> 01:07:44.880
I'm going to finish having my period.

01:07:45.260 --> 01:07:47.040
She says, what can I do to them?

01:07:48.080 --> 01:07:49.960
She's just wiser than they ever would be.

01:07:51.140 --> 01:07:52.780
I said, we hug our women.

01:07:52.920 --> 01:07:53.500
We hug our women.

01:07:53.500 --> 01:07:59.500
that's right we kiss do you kiss also the kiss I mean you kiss your relatives

01:07:59.500 --> 01:08:07.740
or your sisters and we also kiss I also kiss my niece and my my of course my

01:08:07.740 --> 01:08:18.040
grandchildren my children my my cousins but I don't know that yes I mean yeah I

