And in the old Magin David synagogue in Brooklyn, in weekdays, the women wouldn't go up there because it's too much there.

01:08:33.800 --> 01:08:34.420
There's a section in the back.

01:08:34.480 --> 01:08:35.520
There's a section in the back.

01:08:35.740 --> 01:08:40.960
So Hakham Matlub comes and the synagogue is full of people.

01:08:41.680 --> 01:08:43.900
And it's just by the women, next to the women.

01:08:45.480 --> 01:08:46.620
It's not on Shabbat, it's a weekday.

01:08:46.620 --> 01:08:47.400
It was a weekday.

01:08:48.040 --> 01:08:54.840
and the the the pay the fish and somebody asked him why is it a woman and he said to them a

