beautiful answer says i am much i i i am as much a man to them as they are women to me means there's

01:09:05.000 --> 01:09:11.800
no men and women at our age you know there is no you know you know is there yeah yeah there are

01:09:11.800 --> 01:09:20.920
the people that this is what you know it says i i am much as a man to them as they are to me yeah

01:09:25.720 --> 01:09:28.200
i get a kid in our city it's not my synagogue getting

01:09:28.200 --> 01:09:31.880
over here in the synagogue where i go on shabbat we have a mechitsa

01:09:31.880 --> 01:09:34.840
Now, wherever Mechitsa, we have a...

