So why do you keep turning around and smiling and making jokes with the lady up there?

01:10:08.040 --> 01:10:11.040
It drives me crazy. Not because I want to be sent away from the woman.

01:10:11.040 --> 01:10:16.040
As far as my wife and I are concerned, they can sit right behind us or on one side of us.

01:10:16.040 --> 01:10:20.040
The whole idea is not to disturb the prayer. That's what I'm concerned.

01:10:20.040 --> 01:10:24.040
And besides, when we did it in our synagogue, a small synagogue on 6th Avenue,

01:10:24.040 --> 01:10:27.040
before it became a Moroccan synagogue, the women were very...

01:10:27.040 --> 01:10:31.040
Everybody was very quiet. Rabbi Gambach was the Rabbi.

